--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This theme contains no bundled third-party libraries. All CSS and JavaScript is
original and dependency-free.

Fonts are loaded at runtime from Google Fonts (Orbitron, SIL Open Font License
1.1) and from Shopify's own font library via the font_picker setting. Neither is
redistributed with this theme.

3D and AR viewing uses Shopify's native model-viewer integration; no third-party
3D library is bundled.
